<title>LATVIA: Latvian October unemployment 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Latvian October unemployment 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in the Baltic state of Latvia was running at 7.1 percent in October, slightly higher than the seven percent registered the previous month, the state statistics committee said on Friday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     Oct '96     Sept '96    Oct '95</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)   7.1	   7.0	  6.0</p>
<p> Number of unemployed     89,000	88,500	76,800</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
